PARAMETERS 24
6		! 1 File Type
32		! 2 Logical unit
3		! 3 Tilted Surface Radiation Mode
0.2		! 4 Ground reflectance - no snow
0.7		! 5 Ground reflectance - snow cover
6		! 6 Number of surfaces
1  ! Tracking mode-1
0 ! Slope of surface-1
AA_H_0_0 ! Azimuth of surface-1
1  ! Tracking mode-2
